# covers: 6 Recursive resource cleanup
# covers: 7 Resource cleanup
# covers: 7 Deterministic destruction
# kind: positive
# expect: run
# exit: 0
# stdout: 4
# stdout: removed

nestedFiles is module
nestedFiles purpose "Open the same file at every level of a recursion, release each by a deferred cleanup, then prove every handle was released by removing the file"
nestedFiles path nestedFiles
nestedFiles imports standard.console
nestedFiles imports standard.fs
nestedFiles imports standard.math
nestedFiles imports standard.compare
nestedFiles imports standard.string
nestedFiles imports standard.time
nestedFiles exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter scope none

showInt is operation
showInt purpose "Print one whole number on its own line"
showInt invariant none
showInt typeParam none
showInt input value Int64 value
showInt output none
showInt outputOwner none
showInt raises none
showInt effect write console.stdout
showInt uses stdoutWriter
showInt memory heap false
showInt async false
showInt maxRecursion none
showInt label begin loopKind none
showInt label begin within none
showInt label done loopKind none
showInt label done within none
showInt at begin do writeValue
showInt at begin branch ifError writeValue goto done else goto done
showInt at done return ok none

writeValue is call
writeValue rationale "A test program has nowhere to report a failed write"
writeValue in showInt
writeValue invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeValue arg value Int64 value copy
writeValue out none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeError console.WriteError

showText is operation
showText purpose "Print one line of text"
showText invariant none
showText typeParam none
showText input text String borrowed
showText output none
showText outputOwner none
showText raises none
showText effect write console.stdout
showText uses stdoutWriter
showText memory heap false
showText async false
showText maxRecursion none
showText label begin loopKind none
showText label begin within none
showText label done loopKind none
showText label done within none
showText at begin do writeValue
showText at begin branch ifError writeValue goto done else goto done
showText at done return ok none

writeValue is call
writeValue rationale "A test program has nowhere to report a failed write"
writeValue in showText
writeValue invokes console.writeLine
writeValue arg text String text lend
writeValue out none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeError console.WriteError

fileAccess is capability
fileAccess purpose "Authority over files whose names start with suite-"
fileAccess grants read fs.files
fileAccess grants write fs.files
fileAccess scope "suite-*"

nest is operation
nest purpose "Open the file, recurse until depth reaches zero, and count the levels that held it open"
nest invariant none
nest typeParam none
nest input depth Int64 value
nest output Int64
nest outputOwner none
nest raises none
nest effect read fs.files
nest uses fileAccess
nest memory heap false
nest async false
nest maxRecursion 10
nest label begin loopKind none
nest label begin within none
nest label opened loopKind none
nest label opened within none
nest label last loopKind none
nest label last within none
nest label deeper loopKind none
nest label deeper within none
nest label failed loopKind none
nest label failed within none
nest let path immutable String "suite-nested.txt"
nest let zero immutable Int64 0
nest let one immutable Int64 1
nest at begin do openIt
nest at begin branch ifError openIt goto failed else goto opened
nest at opened defer closeItCleanup
nest at opened do atBottom
nest at opened branch if bottom goto last else goto deeper
nest at last return ok one
nest at deeper do less
nest at deeper do recurse
nest at deeper do addOne
nest at deeper return ok levels
nest at failed return ok zero

openIt is call
openIt in nest
openIt invokes fs.openRead
openIt arg path String path lend
openIt out file fs.FileHandle
openIt ownedBy nest
openIt cleanedBy closeItCleanup
openIt borrows none
openIt catch openError fs.FileError

closeItCleanup is cleanup
closeItCleanup in nest
closeItCleanup call closeIt
closeItCleanup cleans file
closeItCleanup onFailure suppress
closeItCleanup because "A failed close has nobody to report to"

closeIt is call
closeIt in nest
closeIt invokes fs.close
closeIt arg file fs.FileHandle file give
closeIt out none
closeIt ownedBy none
closeIt cleanedBy none
closeIt borrows none
closeIt catch closeError fs.FileError

atBottom is call
atBottom in nest
atBottom invokes compare.equalInt64
atBottom arg left Int64 depth copy
atBottom arg right Int64 zero copy
atBottom out bottom Bool
atBottom ownedBy none
atBottom cleanedBy none
atBottom borrows none
atBottom catch none

less is call
less in nest
less invokes math.subtractInt64
less arg left Int64 depth copy
less arg right Int64 one copy
less out smaller Int64
less ownedBy none
less cleanedBy none
less borrows none
less catch none

recurse is call
recurse in nest
recurse invokes nest
recurse arg depth Int64 smaller copy
recurse out below Int64
recurse ownedBy none
recurse cleanedBy none
recurse borrows none
recurse catch none

addOne is call
addOne in nest
addOne invokes math.addInt64
addOne arg left Int64 below copy
addOne arg right Int64 one copy
addOne out levels Int64
addOne ownedBy none
addOne cleanedBy none
addOne borrows none
addOne catch none

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParam none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwner none
main raises none
main effect read fs.files
main effect write console.stdout
main effect write fs.files
main uses fileAccess
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap false
main async true
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label descend loopKind none
main label descend within none
main label removed loopKind none
main label removed within none
main label failed loopKind none
main label failed within none
main let path immutable String "suite-nested.txt"
main let content immutable String "nested"
main let three immutable Int64 3
main let waitMs immutable Int64 5000
main let removedText immutable String "removed"
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0
main let failCode immutable ExitCode 1
main at begin do makeDeadline
main at begin do toBytes
main at begin start writeIt
main at begin join writeIt
main at begin branch ifError writeIt goto failed else goto descend
main at descend do runNest
main at descend do showLevels
main at descend do removeIt
main at descend branch ifError removeIt goto failed else goto removed
main at removed do showRemoved
main at removed return ok okCode
main at failed return ok failCode

makeDeadline is call
makeDeadline in main
makeDeadline invokes time.Deadline.after
makeDeadline arg milliseconds Int64 waitMs copy
makeDeadline out deadline time.Deadline
makeDeadline ownedBy none
makeDeadline cleanedBy none
makeDeadline borrows none
makeDeadline catch none

toBytes is call
toBytes in main
toBytes invokes string.toBytes
toBytes arg text String content lend
toBytes out contentBytes Bytes
toBytes ownedBy none
toBytes cleanedBy none
toBytes borrows content
toBytes catch none

writeIt is task
writeIt in main
writeIt invokes fs.writeAll
writeIt arg path String path lend
writeIt arg bytes Bytes contentBytes lend
writeIt arg deadline time.Deadline deadline copy
writeIt out none
writeIt ownedBy none
writeIt cleanedBy none
writeIt borrows none
writeIt catch writeError fs.FileError

runNest is call
runNest in main
runNest invokes nest
runNest arg depth Int64 three copy
runNest out levels Int64
runNest ownedBy none
runNest cleanedBy none
runNest borrows none
runNest catch none

showLevels is call
showLevels in main
showLevels invokes showInt
showLevels arg value Int64 levels copy
showLevels out none
showLevels ownedBy none
showLevels cleanedBy none
showLevels borrows none
showLevels catch none

removeIt is call
removeIt in main
removeIt invokes fs.remove
removeIt arg path String path lend
removeIt out none
removeIt ownedBy none
removeIt cleanedBy none
removeIt borrows none
removeIt catch removeError fs.FileError

showRemoved is call
showRemoved in main
showRemoved invokes showText
showRemoved arg text String removedText lend
showRemoved out none
showRemoved ownedBy none
showRemoved cleanedBy none
showRemoved borrows none
showRemoved catch none
